# Liliana, Dreadhorde General's -9: "Each opponent chooses a permanent they control of each permanent type and sacrifices
# the rest" (CR 205.2a, 701.21a). Liliana enters with 6 loyalty on turn 1 and gains 1 on turns 1, 3 and 5 (9), and on turn 7
# uses the -9 (she dies at 0, CR 704.5i). Bot2 controls two Plains, Mox Pearl, Crystal Barricade (an artifact creature) and
# Benalish Hero. It chooses by type, in the order artifact, creature, enchantment, land, planeswalker: the Crystal
# Barricade as its artifact and again as its creature (a permanent with two types counts for both, the ruling), and a Plains
# as its land; nothing is asked of a type it has none of. The other Plains, Mox Pearl and Benalish Hero are sacrificed.
# Bot1's own Zombies are untouched (opponents only).

